<div class="faq-page">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="faq-hero">
    <div class="faq-hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Got Questions?</p>
      <h1>FAQ.</h1>
      <p class="faq-hero-sub">Everything you need to know about ordering, shipping, and custom hats.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ ACCORDION -->
  <section class="faq-section">

    <div class="faq-category reveal">
      <h2 class="faq-category-title">Orders & Shipping</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>When will I get my order?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">✦</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          <div class="faq-a-inner">
            <p><strong>Premade Hats</strong>, These designs are ready to go. Most premade orders ship within <strong>2-4 business days</strong>.</p>
            <p><strong>Custom Hats</strong>, Custom orders require more time. Allow <strong>up to 3 weeks</strong> for production and shipping. Once your order is placed, we'll send a <strong>digital mockup</strong> of your design for approval before any stitching begins. Start your order on the <a href="/pages/quote">custom order page</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>How much does shipping cost?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">✦</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          <div class="faq-a-inner">
            <p>Standard shipping is <strong>free on all orders</strong>. If you need expedited delivery, reach out through the contact form with your location and preferred speed and we'll provide a quote for the upgrade.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Where are your hats made?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">✦</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          <div class="faq-a-inner">
            <p>All of our hats are designed and stitched in-house right here in <strong>Burlington, North Carolina</strong>. Every piece is made individually, nothing is outsourced or mass-produced.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-category reveal reveal-d1">
      <h2 class="faq-category-title">Custom Orders</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What's the minimum order for custom hats?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">✦</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          <div class="faq-a-inner">
            <p>Our minimum for custom and wholesale orders is <strong>10 hats</strong>. The more you order, the better the pricing. Head to our <a href="/pages/quote">custom order page</a> to build your order and see live pricing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What file format should I send for my logo?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">✦</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          <div class="faq-a-inner">
            <p>We accept PNG, JPG, PDF, SVG, AI, and EPS files. Vector files (SVG, AI, EPS) work best for embroidery digitizing, but we can work with most formats. Don't have a file ready? Describe your design on the <a href="/pages/quote">custom order page</a> and we'll work with you.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Do I get to see a mockup before you stitch?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">✦</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          <div class="faq-a-inner">
            <p>Yes, always. After you place your order, we send a <strong>digital mockup</strong> of your design on the hat for your approval. Once you approve it, we proceed with production. <strong>Nothing gets stitched without your sign-off.</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What's the difference between flat stitch and 3D puff?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">✦</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          <div class="faq-a-inner">
            <p><strong>Flat stitch</strong> sits flush against the fabric, great for detailed logos, small text, and complex designs.</p>
            <p><strong>3D puff</strong> uses a foam layer under the stitching so the design raises off the hat. Bold and eye-catching, but works best with simple block letters and shapes. Not all designs are compatible with 3D puff, and it carries an additional charge. We'll advise you if your design isn't a good fit.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What hat brands do you carry?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">✦</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          <div class="faq-a-inner">
            <p>We carry all major brands including <strong>Otto, Richardson, Yupoong, and Atonal</strong>, with styles ranging from structured snapbacks to trucker and printed camo 5-panels. You can see our current custom lineup and pricing on the <a href="/pages/quote">custom order page</a>. Need a specific brand or style we don't list? Mention it there and we'll source it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-category reveal reveal-d2">
      <h2 class="faq-category-title">Returns & Exchanges</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What is your return policy?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">✦</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          <div class="faq-a-inner">
            <p><strong>All sales are final.</strong> Because every hat is made to order, whether premade or custom, we do not accept returns or exchanges.</p>
            <p>The only exception is if we made a mistake on our end. If your order arrived wrong or damaged due to an error we made, we'll make it right. Reach out within 7 days of delivery with photos and we'll sort it out immediately.</p>
            <p>We send a digital mockup for approval before running custom orders for exactly this reason, so both sides are confident before we proceed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-category reveal reveal-d2">
      <h2 class="faq-category-title">Premade Hats</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Are premade hats in stock?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">✦</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          <div class="faq-a-inner">
            <p>Premade hats are made to order, the design is already set, but each hat is stitched when you order. They ship within <strong>2-4 business days</strong> with free shipping on every order.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Can I request a different color on a premade design?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">✦</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a">
          <div class="faq-a-inner">
            <p>Some premade designs have multiple color variants available, check the product page for options. For a fully custom colorway, that would fall under a custom order. <a href="/pages/contactus">Contact us</a> and we'll figure it out.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- STILL HAVE QUESTIONS CTA -->
  <section class="faq-cta">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">Still have questions?</p>
    <h2 class="reveal reveal-d1">We'll Answer<br>Personally.</h2>
    <p class="reveal reveal-d2">No bots, no runaround. Reach out and you'll hear back from a real person within 24 hours.</p>
    <a href="mailto:help@threadbreak.com" class="btn btn-fill reveal reveal-d3">help@threadbreak.com</a>
  </section>

</div>
